{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>See, You say to me.</b> 'See' — set your eyes and your heart upon Your words." "<b>You say to me, etc. and You have not made known to me, etc.</b> What You said to me, 'Behold, I send an angel' — this is not a making-known, for I have no desire in it." "<b>And You said, I have known you by name.</b> I have recognized you from the rest of mankind with a name of distinction — for You said to me, 'Behold, I come to you in the thickness of the cloud, etc.' and 'also in you they shall believe forever' (Exodus 19)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 33, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:56:20.553565356Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}